    {
      "kind": "markdown",
      "text": "## FileLogSink\n\n### Data Structure"
    },
    {
      "kind": "type",
      "type_id": "type:trifecta.io.FileLog"
    },
    {
      "kind": "markdown",
      "text": "## Prompt\n\nA console interface for the user to query state and issue commands.\n\n## CommandParser\n\nLoads a sequence of commands from a structured file (e.g., JSON). Each command indicates a delay since the last\ncommand, an action to take, and an optional tag string. Commands simulate manual oversight and administration of\nthe factory and are routed to static singletons (e.g., actor.Directory.instance()._____()).\n\n## Interfaces"
    },
    {
      "kind": "type",
      "type_id": "type:trifecta.io.ITextLog"
    },
    {
      "kind": "type",
      "type_id": "type:trifecta.io.ITextLogSink"
    },
    {
      "kind": "markdown",
      "text": "## Enumerations"
    },
    {
      "kind": "type",
      "type_id": "type:trifecta.io.LogContext"
    }
  ],
